<title>USA: Morrison named to succeed Johnson at Campbell.</title>
<headline>Morrison named to succeed Johnson at Campbell.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dale Morrison was named on Monday to succeed David Johnson as president and chief executive officer of Campbell Soup Co.</p>
<p>Johnson, 64, will remain chairman of the company and of the board's executive committee until his retirement on July 31, 1998, Campbell said in a press release.</p>
